<%# How many of the spec's scenarios have evidence naming them. A count of what was reported, never a pass. %>
<% if (specPanel.spec) { %>
<p><small><%= specPanel.spec.coverage.with_evidence %> of <%= specPanel.spec.coverage.scenarios %> scenarios in the <%= specPanel.spec.state === "accepted" ? "agreed" : "suggested" %> test spec have evidence naming them, as reported.</small></p>
<% } %>
